<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ur">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Khan Fitness Gym - Get Fit, Stay Healthy!</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: #121212;
            color: #ffffff;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        header {
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.8), rgba(0,0,0,0.8)), url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534438327276-14e5300c3a48?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80');
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 80px 20px;
            border-bottom: 4px solid #ff3e3e;
        }

        header h1 {
            font-size: 2.8rem;
            color: #ff3e3e;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        header p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: #dddddd;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 30px 20px;
        }

        .section {
            background-color: #1e1e1e;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }

        h2 {
            color: #ff3e3e;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #333;
            padding-bottom: 8px;
        }

        ul {
            list-style: none;
        }

        ul li {
            background-color: #2a2a2a;
            margin: 10px 0;
            padding: 12px 15px;
            border-left: 4px solid #ff3e3e;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        .timing-box {
            background: #2a2a2a;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .cta-btn {
            display: block;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 300px;
            margin: 30px auto 10px auto;
            padding: 15px;
            background-color: #25d366;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            border-radius: 50px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.4);
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .cta-btn:hover {
            background-color: #1ebc57;
            transform: scale(1.03);
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            color: #777;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            border-top: 1px solid #222;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>Khan Fitness Gym</h1>
        <p>Get Fit, Stay Healthy!</p>
    </header>

    <div class="container">
        
        <div class="section">
            <h2>About Us</h2>
            <p>Humare paas modern machinery, certified trainers, aur full AC environment hai. Aapki fitness journey ko aasan aur effective banana humari pehli tarjeeh hai.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h2>Our Services</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>💪 Weight Loss Program</li>
                <li>🏋️ Muscle Building</li>
                <li>🎯 Personal Training</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h2>Gym Timings</h2>
            <div class="timing-box">
                <p><strong>Morning:</strong> 6:00 AM - 11:00 AM</p>
                <p style="margin-top: 8px;"><strong>Evening:</strong> 4:00 PM - 10:00 PM</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h2>Location</h2>
            <p>📍 Main Market, Gulberg, Lahore.</p>
        </div>

        <a href="https://wa.me/923001234567?text=Assalam-o-Alaikum,%20mujhe%20Gym%20membership%20ke%20baare%20mein%20info%20chahiye" class="cta-btn" target="_blank">
            💬 Contact on WhatsApp
        </a>

    </div>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; Khan Fitness Gym. All Rights Reserved.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
